[I] Broadcom Linux hybrid wireless driver

[T] broadcom-wl is the Broadcom STA Linux hybrid wireless driver, consisting
[T] of a proprietary binary blob with an open source shim. It supports
[T] various Broadcom BCM43xx chipsets not handled by the free b43 and
[T] brcmsmac drivers.

[U] https://github.com/antoineco/broadcom-wl

